<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5264" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμῐγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unmixed, pure,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδοναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1173a23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ καθαρός,</span> of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				989b15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐλάχιστα καὶ ἀ. πέρατα τῶν
				μηκῶν,</span> of geometrical points, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1p.17U.
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰλικρινῶς Ἕλληνες καὶ ἀ. βαρβάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Mx.</u>
					245d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς ἄλληλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					265e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CD</u>
					2.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.70b
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.68
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					<u>Epim.</u>
					254
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>virgin,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. βίβλοι</span> rolls <i>containing a
				single author,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμμιγεῖς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>Proll.Ar.</u>
			</span></i></div>
